# AI-001 mesh-generation environment (STRATA, T4 16 GB, Python 3.13.16).
# Authored 2026-11-18 under A0012 (Director I2 bypass, AI-001 only).
# Minimal set for the audited InstantMesh / TripoSR codepaths on py3.13.
# Deviations from upstream InstantMesh requirements.txt (recorded in
# docs/qa/AI_THROUGHPUT.md):
#   - pytorch-lightning kept (run.py imports seed_everything; model files
#     import pytorch_lightning), but gradio/train demos excluded
#   - diffusers/transformers NOT pinned to 0.20.2/4.34.1 (no py3.13 wheels
#     guarantees); see compiled lock for resolved versions
#   - rembg kept although inference runs with --no_rembg, because run.py and
#     src/utils/infer_util.py import it at module import time
#   - PyMCubes / xformers / torchmcubes EXCLUDED: NeRF variants only
#     (instant-nerf-*); the audited path uses the FlexiCubes mesh model
#   - nvdiffrast NOT on PyPI; installed separately from the upstream VCS repo
#   - opencv-python-headless added: src/utils/mesh_util.py imports cv2
#   - torchaudio, bitsandbytes, tensorboard, webdataset, accelerate,
#     huggingface-hub gradio demo deps EXCLUDED: not imported by run.py
torch
torchvision
numpy
pillow
trimesh
pytorch-lightning
omegaconf
einops
transformers
diffusers
huggingface-hub
safetensors
rembg
xatlas
opencv-python-headless
imageio[ffmpeg]
tqdm
requests
